this is because the BIND code, especially the 'independent programs'
like named, nslookup, etc., is _NOT_ currently 64-bit safe.

Work is being done to integrate the latest version of the BIND code
into NetBSD, and that may solve this problem.

I would _strongly_ discurage people from running named until a new
version of BIND is imported.



chris

